# mai exemptions for maxhammons.com.
#
# WHAT THIS SUPPRESSES, stated plainly:
#
#   site/   generated output of build.py: every file here is rebuilt from source,
#           so findings would be repaired in a copy and lost on the next build.
#   raw/    verbatim mirror of the old Adobe Portfolio export (HTML + their CSS).
#           It is the input to the build and is never edited by hand.
#   fonts/  binary font files.
#
# Everything else (build.py, make_manifest.py, qa.py, theme/, content/) is gated.
site/
raw/
fonts/
